assetEditor.deletePackModal.text = 確定要刪除資產包「{packId}」嗎？\n\n警告: 這是危險操作！\n\n• 此包中的所有資產將被永久刪除\n• 在執行時期刪除資產包可能導致非預期的行為、當機或資料損毀\n• 其他包中對此包資產的任何參照都將損壞\n• 此操作無法復原\n\n只有在您完全了解後果的情況下才繼續。
\n\
WARNING: This is a DANGEROUS operation!\n\
\n\
• All assets within this pack will be permanently deleted\n\
• Deleting an asset pack at runtime can lead to unexpected behavior, crashes, or data corruption\n\
• Any references to assets in this pack from other packs will become broken\n\
• This action cannot be undone\n\
\n\
Only proceed if you fully understand the consequences.
assetEditor.deletePackModal.confirmButton = 刪除包

